// P04.17 (D4.13): the slow part of the symbol-name tests (unit tests named
// SymbolNameLong.* and SemaSymbolsLong.*, disabled in `check-unit`): 1.5
// million mutated names, a corpus of 40000 entities, a name a million levels
// deep, and the near-linear checks (eight shapes of name at 4000 and 64000,
// five shapes of checker type at 10000 and 160000; a fifth of the work under
// ASan where noted in the tests).
// REQUIRES: long
// RUN: timeout 120 %gopp_unit_tests --gtest_also_run_disabled_tests --gtest_filter='SymbolNameLong.*:SemaSymbolsLong.*'
